{"type":"message","id":"7b448bca","parentId":"6d482dc0","timestamp":"2026-05-13T05:58:35.948Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Creating a restart script**\n\nI'm considering how to create a script file to set up a restart button for Openclaw on Ubuntu. I think a desktop launcher button is needed, but I have to ensure it's authorized. I can create a script in my workspace without changing the system. So, I might need a script that installs this desktop button, possibly involving some sudo commands. I should also include commands for creating the .desktop file and ensure it executes properly.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_079b9ccb28e0a130016a0412f5e2e0819181a0a1296d9f881b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqBBL83IS-KQRoUHcoCNndgqSY0Y_5UUquytoohr9Efe1erdpYIVr8PPateUo8B80e5-nG5cPMBDMHNYPlnVTvKO4o2USS8NAvY2r44UkNNH0skwFcNf6kjhkp9MyeI0fI_NF3s34XDw160a_j4ui3N67zgGKqfZExi_MSjbc6-6EZYXUx6rNlt48nuuDz1bpeWPFovRtxS8kFAkl7V0lTBX_X7POpaIIBsmo_k8fT5Za-kOiMWcXDSUvKkSeZUZtm3dM1jYrPUplcGqgL1CuX1NXV1zbWSwr6SKhFG_JpcOUp62-V_z2XSchvZgWQtylv8w5uo4lb8A1r-VIqZj8xjAJrOViGR9xnEwrwbifeJY6EQkwN3hAoTBcG4CojIz_vx2f9qFgl7eL9bu5l2BB2y_vrL426yBGro39xscQ_LByuzjZYAzBSRfT3nhwR0KoQ1WtUdQunBgzBJox-MIFYsDgVuKZXSmm-97Iuvg6GKEi60fvhalm5-vwZ8zZyWeLH3aFFC-jK1ou4nKNXFg_2547XjWKzS-9qo_uBFS_7SM6GWLa-UgPhUKIwKDRvkHQhzRwCtLmZrFgi599dDemaz_eHRrjDrlV_qKaBoOpnt0kJ29VQiX0XR0FWU866qDFadY7FG4mlYLQS7W_YqpfrBH-VVgGKBJ8WxdsqwTtBoFo7Nrraq6JhGTwrlDwRCK3ISgMZXR3rOy7CiwRZhc1Be8RChNWwpAR9aOR_kpku7i7LWmw1eQRf0jHgt7nE27XQmKpYSA8K3EDQEBOILsY67SKscnlnlxQu5wTf53ccCRL23UijjhBMFK3k9AECeCYjQA_2H0jSe6Mi9TBjDBpc96uK-qZmgf-iwDaH-GwM0tuCbwNFJ-I19qCcLZOHWku3svC2cezisoPbJOQM4QZhxGXCekqKxJ8e8Tsl5endiWf16qwzt5JjHs2N1wJYUysjPDdRcrotTx9NLbAc5cHDZbxMSoI4QSZM8rCAI6mcMi8kTziJD8G9icJNtTVcJyAdvoA5yZMZymR1Qvb4MTp6tKsrFWuezl-coAPVujRyjh1Zmu3FnMN_T1ibzC_NKSit9Xrdd_C-LuGSpDqeR507GUR7uc_cSptUXMqEAp_MOApLfyn423b2zu9rDNIy-g3y8nviaEEh5frrPafyXbofEdU59lGgkEtaAKYzxBwcWSJ-RnSHUdsI_8eK1RJ9h96LM