{"type":"message","id":"b47378a5","parentId":"f5d9c82b","timestamp":"2026-05-13T05:58:41.020Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"He creado el script aquí:\n\n`/openclaw/workspace/main/scripts/create-openclaw-restart-button.sh`\n\nQué hace:\n- Crea un lanzador Ubuntu para **reiniciar OpenClaw Gateway**.\n- Usa el comando seguro: `openclaw gateway restart`.\n- Añade confirmación con `zenity` si está disponible.\n- Muestra notificaciones con `notify-send`.\n- Crea acceso en:\n  - `~/.local/share/applications/`\n  - `~/Desktop/` si existe\n\nNo lo he ejecutado; solo he dejado el script preparado. Para instalar el botón:\n\n```bash\nchmod +x /openclaw/workspace/main/scripts/create-openclaw-restart-button.sh\n/openclaw/workspace/main/scripts/create-openclaw-restart-button.sh\n```","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_079b9ccb28e0a130016a04130de5ac8191a9427144d2b727fc\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":9154,"output":170,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9324,"cost":{"input":0.045770000000000005,"output":0.0051,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.050870000000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778651916046,"responseId":"resp_079b9ccb28e0a130016a04130c2fac81919746c573c35ee08a"}}
