 archivos típicos (`README`, `package.json`, etc.). Sigo sin ejecutar nada ni modificar nada.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a8beab88191964b5d68bf2a1010\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7NK8wrViWjisaxspqW2Qau0V|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980ec88191b21015b6e806f6d1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/dashboard-v1/README.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_q4H4uyiIRlPJJPmlBRIovvaN|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980ee48191a206ccc8ea0a96bd","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/dashboard-v1/package.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_F8J8tiBJSVJ9Mnm5aQVCmKD9|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980ef08191a9fadce7c3abeeff","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/dashboard-v1/index.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aCdQmwRM0b91K2Li4fWhoLbV|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980ef881918f837c271a11c5a7","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/dashboard-v1/src/main.tsx"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_XZGv5KchZNw2RjcuyUjq70tG|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980f0881919a29b051b5d57281","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/dashboard-v1/src/App.tsx"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_JnvwbGp6TlUpj9RFqUyhj3PD|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980f108191a0ea8bae335f1623","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/metrics-v1/README.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_KkAhHtU7uyXXHG9TR5p5SUCy|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980f188191ac09580e485e872b","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/metrics-v1/package.json"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_QbHQMbcCpKMIlz0dRPtvfBsJ|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980f20819184b615ff3d3d7cba","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/metrics-v1/index.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_wKEyao5l3hLmoFbW0o3HtojR|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980f248191a889a50536ea6a7d","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/metrics-v1/src/main.tsx"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_AmTIvL3EaS2dKOkCVrSbDSrG|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980f288191addd052bbed3ea42","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/metrics-v1/src/App.tsx"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":9398,"output":453,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9851,"cost":{"input":0.046990000000000004,"output":0.01359,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.06058}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778662022872,"responseId":"resp_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a87073481918bf922d6fa47e071"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e0f5ef8e","parentId":"d4ddeea0","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:47:20.172Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7NK8wrViWjisaxspqW2Qau0V|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980ec88191b21015b6e806f6d1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Dashboard MVP\n\nLocal, static, read-only dashboard concept for Albert and neodaemon.\n\nSecurity principles:\n- Local files only for now.\n- No public exposure.\n- No network service started automatically.\n- No credentials or secrets stored here.\n- MVP first, iterate slowly.\n\nInitial blocks:\n1. Today\n2. Health / mobility\n3. Blood pressure chart and local register\n4. Habits\n5. Pending / chaos inbox\n6. LLM token usage snapshot\n7. Token efficiency: “tokens per useful task”\n8. System health / stability score\n9. Tools / plugins audit\n\nBlood pressure MVP:\n- Inputs: systolic, diastolic, optional pulse, and date/time.\n- Storage: browser `localStorage` under `neodaemon.dashboard.bloodPressure.v1`.\n- The dashboard draws a simple canvas chart for systolic and diastolic values.\n- JSON export is available from the dashboard for backup or future import.\n- No medical interpretation is performed; it is only a private register.\n\nToken usage / efficiency MVP:\n- Usage card shows daily total tokens as `input + output` from the latest manual/session snapshot.\n- Source for efficiency: `/openclaw/workspace/metrics/token_efficiency/YYYY/MM/DD.jsonl`\n- Current values are estimated from `session_status` snapshots, not exact per-task accounting.\n- Channels are grouped as Telegram, TUI, automations, subagents, or unknown.\n- Visual bars are static CSS, with no external libraries or network calls.\n\nStability MVP:\n- Source: `/openclaw/workspace/metrics/stability/YYYY/MM/DD.json`\n- Phase 1 is observe-only: no automatic gateway restarts, no tool freezing, no external alerts.\n- Shows uptime, RAM, CPU load, approximate tokens/hour, critical errors, loops, confirmed gateway restarts, anomalous consumption, and a daily stability score.\n\nTools/plugins audit MVP:\n- Source: `/openclaw/workspace/metrics/tools_plugins/YYYY/MM/DD.json`\n- Read-only inventory: plugins discovered/loaded/disabled, plugin doctor status, eligible skills, active automations, and prudential warnings.\n- No plugin/tool is disabled from the dashboard; changes require explicit Albert approval.\n\nQuick launcher:\n- Script: `/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/open-dashboard.sh`\n- Desktop entry: `/openclaw/workspace/dashboard/neodaemon-dashboard.desktop`\n- The launcher starts a local-only server on `127.0.0.1:8765` from the workspace root and opens `/dashboard/` in the browser.\n- This lets the dashboard read local health data such as `/health/blood_pressure/YYYY/MM/DD.jsonl` and add dictated values to the chart.\n\nOpen through the launcher/local server when using live local data; direct `file://` opening may not load JSONL health records.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778662040171}}
{"type":"message","id":"ed0ec0b8","parentId":"e0f5ef8e","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:47:20.172Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_q4H4uyiIRlPJJPmlBRIovvaN|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980ee48191a206ccc8ea0a96bd","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"tool\": \"read\",\n  \"error\": \"ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/openclaw/workspace/main/review/dashboard-v1/package.json'\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"error","tool":"read","error":"ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/openclaw/workspace/main/review/dashboard-v1/package.json'"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1778662040171}}
{"type":"message","id":"80c93f43","parentId":"ed0ec0b8","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:47:20.172Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_F8J8tiBJSVJ9Mnm5aQVCmKD9|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043a980ef08191a9fadce7c3abeeff","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Albert · Dashboard MVP</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: dark;\n      --bg: #0d1117;\n      --panel: #161b22;\n      --panel-2: #1f2630;\n      --text: #e6edf3;\n      --muted: #8b949e;\n      --accent: #58a6ff;\n      --ok: #3fb950;\n      --warn: #d29922;\n      --border: #30363d;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n    main {\n      width: 100vw;\n      max-width: none;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n    }\n    header {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 16px;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 6px;\n      font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n    }\n    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }\n    .brand {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n    .brand-logo {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(88, 166, 255, .12);\n    }\n    .header-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }\n    .header-actions button { width: auto; margin: 0; padding: 7px 10px; font-size: .9rem; }\n    .card { position: relative; }\n    .card[draggable=\"true\"] { cursor: grab; }\n    .card[draggable=\"true\"]:active { cursor: grabbing; }\n    .card.dragging {\n      opacity: .45;\n      outline: 2px dashed var(--accent);\n      outline-offset: 3px;\n    }\n    .card.drag-over {\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n    }\n    .drag-hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; margin-top: 6px; }\n    .card { min-width: 0; width: 100%; }\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      grid-template-rows: repeat(2, minmax(390px, 1fr));\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n      width: calc(100vw - 24px);\n      max-width: none;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .dashboard-block {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      min-height: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .dashboard-block.tall { grid-row: span 2; }\n    .block-section {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 9px;\n      min-height: 0;\n    }\n    .block-section + .block-section {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      padding-top: 12px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .92rem;\n      letter-spacing: .06em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n    .control-grid { grid-template-rows: auto auto; }\n    .block-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1.08rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      letter-spacing: .02em;\n    }\n    .block-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 9px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n    }\n    .block-grid.single { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .block-grid.fill { flex: 1; }\n    .mini-card {\n      background: rgba(31, 38, 48, .55);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 10px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n    .mini-card.primary {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #162033 0%, rgba(31, 38, 48, .65) 70%);\n      border-color: rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n    }\n    .mini-card.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n    .mini-card.compact { min-height: 82px; }\n    .mini-card h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: .98rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    .technical h3 { color: var(--muted); }\n    @media (max-width: 1100px) {\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: none; width: 100%; }\n      .dashboard-block { min-height: auto; }\n      .dashboard-block.tall { grid-row: auto; }\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 720px) {\n      .block-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .mini-card.full { grid-column: auto; }\n    }\n    h2, h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: .98rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }\n    li { margin: 4px 0; }\n    .pill {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .85rem;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .safe { color: var(--ok); }\n    .warn { color: var(--warn); }\n    .metric {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 5px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    .metric:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .metric strong { color: var(--text); text-align: right; }\n    .bar {\n      height: 9px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      overflow: hidden;\n      margin: 4px 0 8px;\n    }\n    .bar > span {\n      display: block;\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: inherit;\n      background: var(--accent);\n    }\n    .bar .ok { background: var(--ok); }\n    .bar .warn-bg { background: var(--warn); }\n    .small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }\n    .form-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    label { color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; }\n    input, button {\n      width: 100%;\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--text);\n      padding: 8px;\n      font: inherit;\n    }\n    button {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #07111f;\n      border: 0;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    button.secondary {\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    canvas {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: clamp(185px, 21vh, 250px);\n      display: block;\n      background: #0b1017;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      margin: 8px 0 10px;\n    }\n    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; max-height: 118px; }\n    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .86rem; }\n    th, td { padding: 4px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; }\n    th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }\n    .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n    .actions button { width: auto; min-width: 150px; }\n\n    footer {\n      margin-top: 12px;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .9rem;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <img class=\"brand-logo\" src=\"assets/neodaemon-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Logo neodaemon\" />\n        <div>\n          <h1>Dashboard MVP</h1>\n          <p class=\"subtitle\">Albert + neodaemon · local, privado, mínimo viable</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"header-actions\">\n        <button class=\"secondary\" id=\"reset-layout\" type=\"button\">Restaurar orden</button>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2 class=\"block-title\">Salud</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid single fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary full\" id=\"blood-pressure-section\">\n            <h3>Tensión arterial</h3>\n            <p class=\"small\">Registro privado. Guarda sistólica, diastólica, pulso y fecha/hora.</p>\n            <form id=\"bp-form\">\n              <div class=\"form-row\">\n                <label>Sistólica\n                  <input id=\"bp-sys\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"60\" max=\"260\" placeholder=\"120\" required />\n                </label>\n                <label>Diastólica\n                  <input id=\"bp-dia\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"40\" max=\"160\" placeholder=\"80\" required />\n                </label>\n                <label>Pulso opcional\n                  <input id=\"bp-pulse\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" min=\"30\" max=\"220\" placeholder=\"70\" />\n                </label>\n                <label>Fecha y hora\n                  <input id=\"bp-datetime\" type=\"datetime-local\" required />\n                </label>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"actions\">\n                <button type=\"submit\">Añadir lectura</button>\n                <button class=\"secondary\" id=\"bp-export\" type=\"button\">Exportar JSON</button>\n                <button class=\"secondary\" id=\"bp-clear\" type=\"button\">Borrar registros</button>\n              </div>\n            </form>\n            <canvas id=\"bp-chart\" width=\"900\" height=\"260\" aria-label=\"Gráfica de tensión arterial\" role=\"img\"></canvas>\n            <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n              <table>\n                <thead>\n                  <tr><th>Fecha</th><th>Sistólica</th><th>Diastólica</th><th>Pulso</th></tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody id=\"bp-table-body\">\n                  <tr><td colspan=\"4\" class=\"small\">Todavía no hay lecturas.</td></tr>\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"pill\">MVP local · datos en localStorage + JSONL diario</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"block-grid\">\n            <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n              <h3>Salud / movilidad</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Dolor 0-10: —</li>\n                <li>Rigidez: —</li>\n                <li>Estiramientos: —</li>\n              </ul>\n              <span class=\"pill\">MVP salud</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n              <h3>Hábitos</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Sueño: —</li>\n                <li>Alimentación: —</li>\n                <li>Deporte: —</li>\n              </ul>\n              <span class=\"pill\">Pilares diarios</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block tall\">\n        <h2 class=\"block-title\">Control diario</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-section\">\n          <h3 class=\"section-title\">Día</h3>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary compact\">\n            <h3>Hoy</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Prioridad: pendiente.</li>\n              <li>Top 3: log diario.</li>\n              <li>Resumen: 09:00.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <span class=\"pill\">/daily/YYYY/MM/DD.md</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Pendientes / caos</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Capturar.</li>\n              <li>Priorizar.</li>\n              <li>Convertir en pasos.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <span class=\"pill warn\">Anticaos</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Seguridad</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"safe\">Privado.</span></li>\n              <li>No expuesto a internet.</li>\n              <li>Sin credenciales.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Solo Albert + neodaemon</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Alertas</h3>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Críticas: 0</li>\n              <li>Revisión tokens: activa.</li>\n              <li>Backups: ligero diario.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Bajo ruido</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"block-section technical\">\n          <h3 class=\"section-title\">Observabilidad</h3>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card\">\n            <h3>Eficiencia · tokens por tarea útil</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tareas útiles hoy</span><strong>1</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens / tarea útil</span><strong>~16.5k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Picos anómalos</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Bajo valor / repetitivas</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <p class=\"small\">Canales hoy</p>\n            <div class=\"small\">Telegram · ~16.5k</div>\n            <div class=\"bar\"><span class=\"warn-bg\" style=\"width: 72%\"></span></div>\n            <div class=\"small\">TUI · 0</div>\n            <div class=\"bar\"><span style=\"width: 0%\"></span></div>\n            <span class=\"pill warn\">MVP local · estimado</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card\">\n            <h3>Tools / plugins</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins descubiertos</span><strong>92</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins activos</span><strong>67</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins deshabilitados</span><strong>25</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugin doctor</span><strong class=\"safe\">limpio</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Skills elegibles</span><strong>7</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Advertencias</span><strong class=\"warn\">3 prudentes</strong></div>\n            <span class=\"pill warn\">Auditoría solo lectura</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block technical\">\n        <h2 class=\"block-title\">Sistema</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary full\">\n            <h3>Salud del sistema</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Estabilidad</span><strong class=\"safe\">100/100</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Gateway uptime</span><strong>13h 40m</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>RAM</span><strong>14% · 1689/11800 MB</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>CPU load</span><strong>0.07 · 0.04 · 0.00</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Errores críticos</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Loops detectados</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Reinicios gateway</span><strong>0</strong></div>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Observación MVP · sin reinicio automático</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Uso LLM / tokens</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens totales</span><strong>22.8k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Entrada</span><strong>21k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Salida</span><strong>1.8k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Contexto</span><strong>11%</strong></div>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Total diario · snapshot manual</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Automatizaciones</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Cron activos</span><strong>3</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Heartbeat</span><strong>30m</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Modo bajo ruido</span><strong>22-08</strong></div>\n            <span class=\"pill\">Controlado</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n      MVP estático. Siguiente iteración: leer datos reales del log diario, sin abrir acceso externo todavía.\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    const BP_STORAGE_KEY = 'neodae…e.v1';\n    const DASHBOARD_LAYOUT_KEY = 'neodae…t.v1';\n    let SERVER_BP_READINGS = [];\n\n    function localDatetimeValue(date = new Date()) {\n      const offsetMs = date.getTimezoneOffset() * 60000;\n      return new Date(date.getTime() - offsetMs).toISOString().slice(0, 16);\n    }\n\n    function validBpReading(r) {\n      return Number.isFinite(r.systolic) && Number.isFinite(r.diastolic) && r.recordedAt;\n    }\n\n    function normalizeBpReading(r) {\n      return {\n        systolic: Number(r.systolic),[... 9498 more characters truncated]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778662040172}}
