{"type":"message","id":"9fe02b77","parentId":"e1fdabff","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:47:35.161Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_nWC1TrmJM0adqMPJhScCFmhC|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043aa701c0819196aca2a2aac7e83b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Token efficiency metrics\n\nLocal MVP source for the dashboard metric “tokens por tarea útil”.\n\nPrinciples:\n- Local files only.\n- No external APIs.\n- No paid services.\n- Approximate per-task values until OpenClaw exposes exact task-level token accounting.\n\nDefinition:\n- A useful task is a clear request completed correctly with a verifiable result: file edit, report, decision, reminder, or inspected status.\n- Low-value/repetitive tasks are repeated, ambiguous, failed, or high-consumption interactions without a clear result.\n\nCurrent formula:\n- tokens_total = tokens_in + tokens_out\n- tokens_per_useful_task = tokens_total_delta / useful_tasks_completed\n- anomaly if task token delta > 25k, > 2x recent average, or > 20% available context.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778662055161}}
{"type":"message","id":"96483172","parentId":"9fe02b77","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:47:35.162Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_oz5h0dBUBoYFpDXlNTj37n0k|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043aa702748191b393bb2cf3cc6461","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Stability metrics\n\nLocal MVP for observability and stability. No external APIs, no paid services, no automatic restarts.\n\nScope for phase 1:\n- Observe only.\n- Dashboard health panel.\n- Daily stability score.\n- Loop/anomaly counters from local observations.\n\nCurrent scoring MVP:\n- Start from 100.\n- -25 per critical error.\n- -15 per detected loop.\n- -10 per anomalous token consumption event.\n- -5 per gateway restart detected/confirmed.\n- Minimum score: 0.\n\nLimitations:\n- Gateway restarts are only counted when detected or logged locally.\n- Tokens/hour is approximate from available session snapshots.\n- Recent error detection must ignore template/report headings and false positives.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778662055161}}
{"type":"message","id":"89ae81cc","parentId":"96483172","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:47:35.162Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9VGnXWo6YE9oizNHi1KUXVW0|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a043aa702808191aaf85d901e02c3c9","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Tools / plugins audit metrics\n\nLocal MVP summary for the dashboard. Read-only audit data; no plugin/tool changes are applied from here.\n\nPrinciples:\n- Inventory first.\n- Measure usage/risk later.\n- Disable only after Albert approves.\n- Cost 0€ and no Internet required.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778662055161}}
