nspect what's needed this time. After that, I’ll write and apply the patch, making sure to only modify the index. It seems like there's no need for execution, so I'll focus on just reading. Let’s make sure I’m thorough!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Aplico solo la fase visual sobre `dashboard-v2/index.html`. Mantengo datos actuales y etiquetas; no toco snapshots ni nada activo.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_079b9ccb28e0a130016a044171a2ec8191992b1167aa1144b2\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_t9dIUk8o11yDbQutKx3UdtSs|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a0441740c6c8191bd12f2ff2c6a3120","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/review/dashboard-v1/index.html","offset":1,"limit":260}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aSemh3ERoDNS1ZFClKRVGqMb|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a0441740cb88191bfc242e61faecf74","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/dashboard-v2/index.html"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":1669,"output":160,"cacheRead":35328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37157,"cost":{"input":0.008345,"output":0.0048000000000000004,"cacheRead":0.017664,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.030809}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778663785627,"responseId":"resp_079b9ccb28e0a130016a04416a46dc81918b2a94c9ddfdf367"}}
{"type":"message","id":"00f0216a","parentId":"6c236759","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:16:36.158Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_t9dIUk8o11yDbQutKx3UdtSs|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a0441740c6c8191bd12f2ff2c6a3120","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Albert · Dashboard MVP</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: dark;\n      --bg: #0d1117;\n      --panel: #161b22;\n      --panel-2: #1f2630;\n      --text: #e6edf3;\n      --muted: #8b949e;\n      --accent: #58a6ff;\n      --ok: #3fb950;\n      --warn: #d29922;\n      --border: #30363d;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n    main {\n      width: 100vw;\n      max-width: none;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n    }\n    header {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 16px;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 6px;\n      font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n    }\n    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }\n    .brand {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n    .brand-logo {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(88, 166, 255, .12);\n    }\n    .header-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }\n    .header-actions button { width: auto; margin: 0; padding: 7px 10px; font-size: .9rem; }\n    .card { position: relative; }\n    .card[draggable=\"true\"] { cursor: grab; }\n    .card[draggable=\"true\"]:active { cursor: grabbing; }\n    .card.dragging {\n      opacity: .45;\n      outline: 2px dashed var(--accent);\n      outline-offset: 3px;\n    }\n    .card.drag-over {\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n    }\n    .drag-hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; margin-top: 6px; }\n    .card { min-width: 0; width: 100%; }\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      grid-template-rows: repeat(2, minmax(390px, 1fr));\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n      width: calc(100vw - 24px);\n      max-width: none;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .dashboard-block {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      min-height: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .dashboard-block.tall { grid-row: span 2; }\n    .block-section {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 9px;\n      min-height: 0;\n    }\n    .block-section + .block-section {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      padding-top: 12px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .92rem;\n      letter-spacing: .06em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n    .control-grid { grid-template-rows: auto auto; }\n    .block-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1.08rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      letter-spacing: .02em;\n    }\n    .block-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 9px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n    }\n    .block-grid.single { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .block-grid.fill { flex: 1; }\n    .mini-card {\n      background: rgba(31, 38, 48, .55);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 10px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n    .mini-card.primary {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #162033 0%, rgba(31, 38, 48, .65) 70%);\n      border-color: rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n    }\n    .mini-card.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n    .mini-card.compact { min-height: 82px; }\n    .mini-card h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: .98rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    .technical h3 { color: var(--muted); }\n    @media (max-width: 1100px) {\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: none; width: 100%; }\n      .dashboard-block { min-height: auto; }\n      .dashboard-block.tall { grid-row: auto; }\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 720px) {\n      .block-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .mini-card.full { grid-column: auto; }\n    }\n    h2, h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: .98rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }\n    li { margin: 4px 0; }\n    .pill {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .85rem;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    .safe { color: var(--ok); }\n    .warn { color: var(--warn); }\n    .metric {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 5px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    .metric:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .metric strong { color: var(--text); text-align: right; }\n    .bar {\n      height: 9px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      overflow: hidden;\n      margin: 4px 0 8px;\n    }\n    .bar > span {\n      display: block;\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: inherit;\n      background: var(--accent);\n    }\n    .bar .ok { background: var(--ok); }\n    .bar .warn-bg { background: var(--warn); }\n    .small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }\n    .form-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    label { color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; }\n    input, button {\n      width: 100%;\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--text);\n      padding: 8px;\n      font: inherit;\n    }\n    button {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #07111f;\n      border: 0;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    button.secondary {\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n    canvas {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: clamp(185px, 21vh, 250px);\n      display: block;\n      background: #0b1017;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      margin: 8px 0 10px;\n    }\n    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; max-height: 118px; }\n    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .86rem; }\n    th, td { padding: 4px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; }\n    th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }\n    .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n    .actions button { width: auto; min-width: 150px; }\n\n    footer {\n      margin-top: 12px;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .9rem;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <img class=\"brand-logo\" src=\"assets/neodaemon-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Logo neodaemon\" />\n        <div>\n\n[461 more lines in file. Use offset=261 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778663796158}}
{"type":"message","id":"6a7c934c","parentId":"00f0216a","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:16:36.158Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_aSemh3ERoDNS1ZFClKRVGqMb|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a0441740cb88191bfc242e61faecf74","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Neodaemon · Dashboard v2</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: dark;\n      --bg: #0d1117;\n      --panel: #161b22;\n      --panel-2: #1f2630;\n      --text: #e6edf3;\n      --muted: #8b949e;\n      --accent: #58a6ff;\n      --border: #30363d;\n      --warn: #d29922;\n      --ok: #3fb950;\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n\n    main {\n      width: min(1180px, calc(100vw - 24px));\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 18px 0 28px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 16px;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n    }\n\n    h3 {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      font-size: 0.98rem;\n      color: var(--text);\n    }\n\n    .subtitle, .muted, footer {\n      color: var(--muted);\n    }\n\n    .status-banner {\n      border: 1px solid rgba(210, 153, 34, .45);\n      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, .08);\n      color: #f0d58c;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      max-width: 420px;\n    }\n\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .card {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n\n    .card.large { grid-column: span 2; }\n\n    .meta {\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 7px;\n      margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 6px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n\n    .row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n\n    .label { color: var(--muted); }\n    .value { text-align: right; font-weight: 650; }\n\n    .pill {\n      display: inline-block;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      font-size: .82rem;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n\n    .pill.placeholder {\n      color: #f0d58c;\n      border-color: rgba(210, 153, 34, .45);\n      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, .08);\n    }\n\n    .pill.policy {\n      color: #9fc9ff;\n      border-color: rgba(88, 166, 255, .45);\n      background: rgba(88, 166, 255, .08);\n    }\n\n    ul {\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    li { margin: 5px 0; }\n\n    .empty-state {\n      margin: 8px 0 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      background: rgba(31, 38, 48, .55);\n      border: 1px dashed var(--border);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .source {\n      margin-top: 10px;\n      padding-top: 10px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .88rem;\n    }\n\n    code {\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 1px 5px;\n      color: var(--text);\n    }\n\n    footer {\n      margin-top: 18px;\n      font-size: .9rem;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 940px) {\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n      .card.large { grid-column: span 2; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 680px) {\n      main { width: min(100vw - 18px, 1180px); }\n      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .card.large { grid-column: auto; }\n      .row { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }\n      .value { text-align: left; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <header>\n      <div>\n        <h1>Neodaemon · Dashboard v2</h1>\n        <p class=\"subtitle\">Prototipo estático, local y read-only. Sin datos falsos.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status-banner\">\n        <strong>Estado:</strong> fase documental / visual estática.<br />\n        No abre servidor, no ejecuta scripts, no modifica OpenClaw.\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"grid\" aria-label=\"Dashboard v2\">\n      <article class=\"card large\">\n        <h2>Control diario</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Primera métrica real conectada mediante snapshot estático desde el registro local de decisiones.</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Decisiones registradas</span><span class=\"value\">15</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Última decisión</span><span class=\"value\">2026-05-12 · Fase 0 documental Internet STRICT READ-ONLY</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Incertidumbre de formato</span><span class=\"value\">baja</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"source\">\n          Fuente real: <code>logs/decisions.md</code><br />\n          Snapshot: <code>dashboard-v2/snapshots/decisions-summary.json</code><br />\n          Estado: <span class=\"pill policy\">real</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Política de datos</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>No mostrar valores inventados.</li>\n          <li>No usar ceros como sustituto de ausencia de datos.</li>\n          <li>Cada métrica debe tener fuente y fecha.</li>\n          <li>Los placeholders deben verse como placeholders.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"source\">\n          Referencia: <code>PLACEHOLDERS_POLICY.md</code>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Salud privada</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Área reservada para registros privados si Albert lo autoriza en una fase posterior.</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Tensión arterial</span><span class=\"value\">sin registros</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Movilidad</span><span class=\"value\">sin datos</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Hábitos</span><span class=\"value\">sin datos</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"source\">\n          Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span><br />\n          Sin formularios activos. Sin localStorage. Sin interpretación médica.\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Tokens y eficiencia</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Preparado para mostrar consumo y utilidad solo cuando exista snapshot local.</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Tokens diarios</span><span class=\"value\">sin snapshot</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Tareas útiles</span><span class=\"value\">sin registro</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Eficiencia</span><span class=\"value\">no calculada</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"source\">\n          Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/token_efficiency/</code><br />\n          Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Estabilidad</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Observabilidad read-only. No reinicia, no corrige, no automatiza.</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Score</span><span class=\"value\">sin snapshot</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Errores críticos</span><span class=\"value\">sin fuente</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Reinicios gateway</span><span class=\"value\">sin fuente</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"source\">\n          Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/stability/</code><br />\n          Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Tools / plugins</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Inventario futuro en modo solo lectura. Sin botones de cambio.</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Plugins</span><span class=\"value\">sin auditoría</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Tools</span><span class=\"value\">sin inventario</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Acciones</span><span class=\"value\">no disponibles</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"source\">\n          Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/tools_plugins/</code><br />\n          Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card large\">\n        <h2>Fuentes locales previstas</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Rutas propuestas para una fase posterior. Este HTML no las lee ni las modifica.</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li><code>/openclaw/workspace/main/data/metrics/</code></li>\n          <li><code>/openclaw/workspace/main/data/health/</code></li>\n          <li><code>/openclaw/workspace/main/data/snapshots/</code></li>\n          <li><code>/openclaw/workspace/main/memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md</code></li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"source\">\n          Política: <span class=\"pill policy\">local</span> <span class=\"pill policy\">privado</span> <span class=\"pill policy\">read-only</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      Dashboard v2 estático. Si un dato no tiene fuente verificable, se muestra como “sin datos”, “sin snapshot” o “no disponible”.\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778663796158}}
