ing the index layout**\\n\\nI need to focus on modifying just the index. It might be better to rewrite the entire index for an improved layout, keeping it simple and intuitive. I'm considering preserving no JavaScript and using visual classes like \\\"dashboard-block\\\" and \\\"mini-card\\\" to make it look more like version 1. I definitely want to use static values in this process. So, let's go ahead and write the whole file!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_DAn05XS9zcJszKkQm5OJa3t3|fc_079b9ccb28e0a130016a04417bd55081918b060a359d206c12","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/dashboard-v2/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Neodaemon · Dashboard v2</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: dark;\n      --bg: #0d1117;\n      --panel: #161b22;\n      --panel-2: #1f2630;\n      --panel-soft: rgba(31, 38, 48, .55);\n      --text: #e6edf3;\n      --muted: #8b949e;\n      --accent: #58a6ff;\n      --ok: #3fb950;\n      --warn: #d29922;\n      --border: #30363d;\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(88, 166, 255, .08), transparent 34vw),\n        var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n\n    main {\n      width: 100vw;\n      max-width: none;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 10px 12px 16px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 16px;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 6px;\n      font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n      letter-spacing: .01em;\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1.08rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      letter-spacing: .02em;\n    }\n\n    h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: .98rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #162033 0%, rgba(31, 38, 48, .65) 70%);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(88, 166, 255, .12);\n      font-size: 1.35rem;\n    }\n\n    .subtitle, .muted, footer { color: var(--muted); }\n    .subtitle { margin: 0; }\n\n    .header-status {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 8px;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n    }\n\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      grid-template-rows: repeat(2, minmax(390px, auto));\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n      width: calc(100vw - 24px);\n      max-width: none;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .dashboard-block {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      min-width: 0;\n      min-height: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 10px;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, .14);\n    }\n\n    .dashboard-block.tall { grid-row: span 2; }\n\n    .block-section {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 9px;\n      min-height: 0;\n    }\n\n    .block-section + .block-section {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      padding-top: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .82rem;\n      letter-spacing: .08em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .block-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 9px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n    }\n\n    .block-grid.single { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .block-grid.fill { flex: 1; }\n\n    .mini-card {\n      background: var(--panel-soft);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 10px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n\n    .mini-card.primary {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #162033 0%, rgba(31, 38, 48, .65) 70%);\n      border-color: rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n    }\n\n    .mini-card.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n    .mini-card.compact { min-height: 96px; }\n\n    .metric {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 6px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n\n    .metric:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .metric span { color: var(--muted); }\n    .metric strong { color: var(--text); text-align: right; }\n\n    .pill {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      font-size: .82rem;\n      margin: 2px 3px 2px 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .pill.real {\n      color: #9fc9ff;\n      border-color: rgba(88, 166, 255, .45);\n      background: rgba(88, 166, 255, .08);\n    }\n\n    .pill.placeholder {\n      color: #f0d58c;\n      border-color: rgba(210, 153, 34, .45);\n      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, .08);\n    }\n\n    .pill.policy {\n      color: var(--muted);\n      border-color: var(--border);\n      background: rgba(31, 38, 48, .55);\n    }\n\n    .small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }\n\n    .source {\n      margin-top: 10px;\n      padding-top: 10px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .88rem;\n    }\n\n    ul { padding-left