       </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"block-section\">\n          <h3 class=\"section-title\">Gobernanza visual</h3>\n          <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n            <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n              <h3>Política de datos</h3>\n              <ul class=\"small\">\n                <li>No mostrar valores inventados.</li>\n                <li>No usar ceros como ausencia de datos.</li>\n                <li>Cada métrica real necesita fuente.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"source\">Referencia: <code>PLACEHOLDERS_POLICY.md</code></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n              <h3>Estado operativo</h3>\n              <div class=\"metric\"><span>Servidor</span><strong>no usado</strong></div>\n              <div class=\"metric\"><span>Launcher</span><strong>no usado</strong></div>\n              <div class=\"metric\"><span>Lógica activa</span><strong>no disponible</strong></div>\n              <span class=\"pill policy\">read-only</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2>Salud</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid single fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary full\">\n            <h3>Salud privada</h3>\n            <p class=\"small\">Área reservada para registros privados si Albert lo autoriza en una fase posterior.</p>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tensión arterial</span><strong>sin registros</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Movilidad</span><strong>sin datos</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Hábitos</span><strong>sin datos</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span><br />\n              Sin formularios activos. Sin localStorage. Sin interpretación médica.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2>Observabilidad</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Tokens y eficiencia</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tokens diarios</span><strong>sin snapshot</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tareas útiles</span><strong>sin registro</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Eficiencia</span><strong>no calculada</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/token_efficiency/</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Estabilidad</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Score</span><strong>sin snapshot</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Errores críticos</span><strong>sin fuente</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Reinicios gateway</span><strong>sin fuente</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/stability/</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2>Sistema documental</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Tools / plugins</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins</span><strong>sin auditoría</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tools</span><strong>sin inventario</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Acciones</span><strong>no disponibles</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/tools_plugins/</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Fuentes locales previstas</h3>\n            <ul class=\"small\">\n              <li><code>data/metrics/</code></li>\n              <li><code>data/health/</code></li>\n              <li><code>data/snapshots/</code></li>\n              <li><code>memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md</code></li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Política: <span class=\"pill policy\">local</span> <span class=\"pill policy\">privado</span> <span class=\"pill policy\">read-only</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      Dashboard v2 estático. Si un dato no tiene fuente verificable, se muestra como “sin datos”, “sin snapshot” o “no disponible”.\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778663950508}}
{"type":"message","id":"e3d00aef","parentId":"4d5c9c82","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:19:22.469Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Hecho, Albert.\n\nCambié solo:\n\n`/openclaw/workspace/main/dashboard-v2/index.html`\n\nQué mejoré visualmente:\n\n- layout más parecido a v1:\n  - bloques grandes tipo dashboard;\n  - mini-cards internas;\n  - panel “Control diario” destacado;\n  - bloque de “Salud”;\n  - bloque de “Observabilidad”;\n  - bloque de “Sistema documental”.\n- CSS más cercano a v1:\n  - grid 2 columnas;\n  - tarjetas redondeadas;\n  - mini-cards;\n  - pills de estado;\n  - cabecera con marca visual ⚙️;\n  - fondos y bordes más cuidados.\n- Mantuve clara la separación:\n  - `real`;\n  - `no_disponible`;\n  - `sin snapshot`;\n  - `sin fuente`.\n\nConfirmaciones:\n\n- no añadí lógica activa;\n- no añadí JS dinámico;\n- no usé servidor;\n- no usé launcher;\n- no toqué snapshots;\n- no toqué gateway/routing/configuración;\n- no inventé métricas ni copié datos hardcodeados de v1.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_079b9ccb28e0a130016a04421064c881919589a639ae3ad37f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":2095,"output":241,"cacheRead":47616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49952,"cost":{"input":0.010475000000000002,"output":0.00723,"cacheRead":0.023808,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.041513}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778663950510,"responseId":"resp_079b9ccb28e0a130016a04420ecf3c8191ba146a4a57cda8ed"}}
